# Bot1 casts True-Name Nemesis on turn one and chooses Bot2, so it has protection from Bot2 (CR 702.16).
#
# Turn four: Bot2's Fiery Confluence deals 1 damage to each creature and 2 to each opponent twice. Both Guerrilla Gorillas
# take their 1, but the damage to the Nemesis, from a source Bot2 controls, is prevented (702.16e), so the 3/1 lives.
# Bot2 then attacks with a Gorilla and the Nemesis blocks it: the Gorilla's combat damage is prevented too, and the Nemesis
# kills it.
# Turn five: the Nemesis and Bot1's own Gorilla attack. Bot2's untapped Gorilla may block Bot1's Gorilla, but not the Nemesis
# (702.16f); Bot2 blocks nothing and takes 5. (Bot1's Gorilla is there so Bot2 is asked to block at all; with only the
# Nemesis attacking there is no legal block and no question.) Scripts are two-seat, so a third player's creatures
# blocking it is not covered here.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
True-Name Nemesis
Forest
Guerrilla Gorilla
Island
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Guerrilla Gorilla
Guerrilla Gorilla
Fiery Confluence
Mountain
Mountain x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.True-Name Nemesis.Cast
Bot1.ChoosePlayer(Bot2)
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus#1.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot2.Hand.Guerrilla Gorilla.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Guerrilla Gorilla.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Guerrilla Gorilla.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot2.Hand.Fiery Confluence.Cast
Bot2.Modes(1; 2; 2)
[T4 Bot2.BeginCombat]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Guerrilla Gorilla#1.Damage = 1
? Bot1.Battlefield.Guerrilla Gorilla.Damage = 1
? Bot1.Battlefield.True-Name Nemesis.Damage = 0
? Bot1.Life = 16
Bot2.Attack(Guerrilla Gorilla)
Bot1.Block(True-Name Nemesis > Guerrilla Gorilla)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.True-Name Nemesis.Damage = 0
? Bot2.Battlefield.Guerrilla Gorilla.Damage = 1
Bot1.Attack(True-Name Nemesis; Guerrilla Gorilla)
! Bot2.Block(Guerrilla Gorilla > True-Name Nemesis)
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Turn = 5
Bot1.Battlefield = Island; Forest; True-Name Nemesis; Guerrilla Gorilla
Bot2.Battlefield = Forest; Mountain; Guerrilla Gorilla
Bot2.Graveyard = Guerrilla Gorilla; Fiery Confluence; Black Lotus; Black Lotus
Bot1.Life = 16
Bot2.Life = 15
